{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have officially joined the elite team of &quot;Star Wipers&quot;! You now have a unique opportunity to begin your galactic adventure in one of the most demanding sectors of space. Your mission? Cleaning! Alongside your trusted crew, you will embark on exciting expeditions to abandoned space stations, ruined restaurants in the cosmos, and unexplored planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/0d058ed7747223638359d45759c13154.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.webm?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.mp4?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit, your task is not just cleaning \u2013 it's a battle against chaos! You must transform every damaged place into something perfectly clean, as if it were brand new. What can you expect? Armed with a mop, you\u2019ll fight stains in unusual colors \u2013 red, green, and blue liquids that look more like alien substances than regular blood. You\u2019ll be tossing not only trash but also pieces of extraterrestrial beings that left their mark behind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/7292ac5688598fbb8215f8516b2419ef.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f85b11a0baee52c631d293c41366a955.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f85b11a0baee52c631d293c41366a955.webm?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f85b11a0baee52c631d293c41366a955.mp4?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No good cleaner works alone! Gather your crew and take off together to traverse the vast expanse of the universe. Complete missions, tackle challenges, and collect resources to upgrade your gear, acquiring more powerful tools to fight the chaos! Only a united team can conquer the galactic mess ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/7ba67ddfa4574c56aba90ad787a2cd39.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.webm?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.mp4?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned space stations hide dark secrets... And among them \u2013 dangerous, terrifying creatures! Dive into their world, uncover hidden weaknesses, and face unknown threats in a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/811a86fcab69f0a6a97480f6c3b1a7c8.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.webm?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.mp4?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics, physics, physics... The entire game is built around delightful, dynamic physics! Stack towers made of alien body parts, spill water from a bucket, or watch as trash flies out of boxes, leaving a mess all over the floor. Every action brings a new, fun twist to the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We think you\u2019ll love Cleaner Company if you enjoy\u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PEAK, Crime Scene Cleaner, Viscera Cleanup Detail, PowerWash Simulator 2, RV There Yet?, House Flipper 2, Serial Cleaner, Lethal Company, Content Warning and R.E.P.O.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644020?t=1773848024","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644020?t=1773848024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/5a8ee05aec6e33700698a1b3fb2432ff16471535/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773848024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/5a8ee05aec6e33700698a1b3fb2432ff16471535/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773848024","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Players can expect slapstick gory humor, body parts and blood."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have officially joined the elite team of &quot;Star Wipers&quot;! You now have a unique opportunity to begin your galactic adventure in one of the most demanding sectors of space. Your mission? Cleaning! Alongside your trusted crew, you will embark on exciting expeditions to abandoned space stations, ruined restaurants in the cosmos, and unexplored planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/0d058ed7747223638359d45759c13154.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/e249a0f9ae70527798acbbe0ff215f15.webm