 mess ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/7ba67ddfa4574c56aba90ad787a2cd39.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.webm?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/9d226604bc14c9d39358c32ef7f8fe90.mp4?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned space stations hide dark secrets... And among them \u2013 dangerous, terrifying creatures! Dive into their world, uncover hidden weaknesses, and face unknown threats in a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/811a86fcab69f0a6a97480f6c3b1a7c8.webp?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.poster.avif?t=1773848024\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/eb380db3cfe3f4a89fad346b09725ae5.webm?t=1773848024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h